data_MERGE_CHANGED
#
# Changed-state member of the merge-states fixture pair.
#
# Same polymer chain A as the ground member — ALA 1 (blank altloc), SER 2 (two
# conformers A/B, shifted coordinates), GLY 3 (blank altloc) — so polymer
# residues correspond between the two inputs. Non-polymer: W2S at auth_seq_id
# 101, colliding with the ground member's EDO. W2S is present here and absent
# from the ground member.
#
# label_asym_id B / label_entity_id 2 mean W2S here and EDO in the ground
# member. See the note in merge_ground.cif.
#
_entry.id MERGE_CHANGED
#
_cell.entry_id MERGE_CHANGED
_cell.length_a 30.000
_cell.length_b 40.000
_cell.length_c 50.000
_cell.angle_alpha 90.00
_cell.angle_beta 90.00
_cell.angle_gamma 90.00
#
_symmetry.entry_id MERGE_CHANGED
_symmetry.space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
#
loop_
_chem_comp.id
_chem_comp.formula
ALA 'C3 H7 N O2'
SER 'C3 H7 N O3'
GLY 'C2 H5 N O2'
W2S 'C4 H6 N2 O'
#
loop_
_atom_site.group_PDB
